---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
import { services } from '../data/services';
import { roadmap } from '../data/roadmap';

// PLACEHOLDER: points at Contact until the real diagnostic flow ships.
// Re-point this one constant when the diagnostic page exists.
const diagnosticHref = '/contact/';

const pageTitle = 'Services — Solborne & Co.';
const pageDescription =
  'Six AI services, from a free diagnostic to a full readiness assessment. Fixed scope, flat fees, human-checked work — the same care at every price.';
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
  <PageIntro eyebrow="Services" title="A small, sharp set of services, done well.">
    <p>
      We productized the work: fixed scope, a flat price you see before we start, and every
      paid deliverable checked by a human before it reaches you.
    </p>
    <p>
      Priced so that a five-person firm and a five-hundred-person firm can both walk
      through the same door.
    </p>
  </PageIntro>

  <Section label="The catalog" title="Six services, ready today.">
    <!-- ============================================================
         PRICING GATE (deliberate): no price figures on the site.
         Where a price used to render, each row now carries a CTA
         toward the free diagnostic.
         PLACEHOLDER LINK TARGET: the diagnostic flow does not exist
         yet as a real page, so the CTA points at /contact/ for now.
         When the diagnostic page ships, re-point `diagnosticHref`
         here (one place) and the whole catalog follows.
         ============================================================ -->
    <div class="catalog">
      {
        services.map((service) => (
          <article class:list={['row', { flagship: service.flagship }]}>
            <div class="row-name">
              <h3>{service.name}</h3>
              <p class="price-note">{service.priceNote}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="row-body">
              <p class="summary">{service.summary}</p>
              <ul class="deliverables" role="list">
                {service.deliverables.map((item) => (
                  <li>{item}</li>
                ))}
              </ul>
            </div>
            <p class="row-cta">
              <a href={diagnosticHref}>
                {service.slug === 'diagnostic' ? 'Start here' : 'Start with the free diagnostic'}
                <span class="visually-hidden"> — {service.name}</span>
                <span aria-hidden="true"> &rarr;</span>
              </a>
            </p>
          </article>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section label="The roadmap" title="Where this goes next.">
    <p class="roadmap-intro">
      The six services above are staffed and ready today. Everything below is
      the roadmap — real capability, not yet staffed with a named expert, so we don't
      sell it yet. When an item goes live, it moves into the catalog above under the same
      rule as everything else: fixed scope, a human check, the same care at every price.
    </p>

    <!-- Roadmap entries are deliberately non-interactive: no links, no
         CTAs, no pricing. Nothing here can be booked today. -->
    <div class="roadmap">
      {
        roadmap.map((category) => (
          <div class="roadmap-category">
            <h3 class="category-label">{category.name}</h3>
            <ul class="roadmap-list" role="list">
              {category.items.map((item) => (
                <li class="roadmap-item">
                  <div class="roadmap-text">
                    <p class="roadmap-name">{item.name}</p>
                    <p class="roadmap-blurb">{item.blurb}</p>
                  </div>
                  <p class="roadmap-tag">On our roadmap</p>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section label="How engagements run" title="Fixed scope, flat fee, checked work.">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Every engagement runs on a fixed scope and a flat fee, both stated in writing
        before any work begins. The fee we quote is the fee you pay — no meter running, no
        surprise line items at the end. And everyone starts in the same place: the free
        diagnostic.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every paid deliverable is checked by a human before it reaches you — AI does a
        share of the work, but nothing you pay for leaves this firm on a model's word
        alone. The one exception is the diagnostic, which is automated — that is what
        makes it free.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every recommendation carries a confidence level — a number, not a shrug. Where we
        are sure, you will see it; where we are not, you will see that too. And if your
        problem belongs to someone else — a different specialty, a different kind of firm —
        we say so and point you there.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section label="The point">
    <p class="lede">
      The client paying our smallest fee gets exactly the same care as the client paying
      our largest — that isn't a promotion, it's the entire point.
    </p>
  </Section>

  <Section label="Next step">
    <nav class="cta-row" aria-label="Get started">
      <Button href="/contact/">Start with the free diagnostic</Button>
      <Button href="/contact/" variant="ghost">Ask a question</Button>
    </nav>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ---- The catalog: verdict-table-style stack ---- */
  .catalog {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
    border: var(--border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--color-panel);
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr 150px;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    padding: 1.375rem var(--space-md);
    border-top: var(--border-hairline);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .row:first-child {
    border-top: none;
  }

  /* The single permitted amber surface — the flagship engagement. */
  .row.flagship {
    background: var(--color-bearing-wash);
  }

  .row-name h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-h3);
    line-height: var(--leading-heading);
  }

  .price-note {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-tag);
    font-weight: var(--weight-mono);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tag);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-stone);
    margin-top: 0.3125rem;
  }

  .summary {
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-body);
  }

  .deliverables {
    list-style: none;
    margin-top: 0.875rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .deliverables li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.90625rem;
    line-height: var(--leading-tight);
    color: var(--color-body-strong);
  }

  .deliverables li::before {
    content: '+' / '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-positive);
  }

  /* Where the price used to sit: the diagnostic CTA, mono + Steel. */
  .row-cta {
    text-align: right;
    padding-top: 0.1875rem;
  }

  .row-cta a {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: var(--weight-mono-medium);
    font-size: var(--text-tag);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tag);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-steel);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .row-cta a:hover {
    border-bottom-color: var(--color-steel);
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-xs);
    }

    .row-cta {
      text-align: left;
      padding-top: 0;
    }
  }

  /* ---- The roadmap: deliberately lighter than the live catalog ----
     No panel container, no border card, no links — hairline rows in
     Stone-weighted type so the staffed catalog above visibly outranks it. */
  .roadmap-intro {
    max-width: var(--width-measure);
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    line-height: var(--leading-body);
    color: var(--color-body-strong);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .roadmap {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .category-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-label);
    font-weight: var(--weight-mono-medium);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-block-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-stone);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
    padding-bottom: 0.625rem;
    border-bottom: var(--border-hairline);
  }

  .roadmap-list {
    list-style: none;
  }

  .roadmap-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 0.875rem 0;
    border-bottom: var(--border-hairline);
  }

  .roadmap-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .roadmap-name {
    font-weight: var(--weight-body-medium);
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .roadmap-blurb {
    font-size: var(--text-caption);
    line-height: var(--leading-tight);
    color: var(--color-body);
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    max-width: 62ch;
  }

  .roadmap-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-tag);
    font-weight: var(--weight-mono);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tag);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-stone);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .roadmap-item {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.375rem;
    }
  }

  /* ---- How engagements run ---- */
  .prose {
    max-width: var(--width-measure);
  }

  .prose p {
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    line-height: var(--leading-body);
    color: var(--color-body-strong);
  }

  .prose p + p {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
  }

  /* ---- Same care at every price: serif lede pull quote ---- */
  .lede {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: var(--weight-body-medium);
    font-size: var(--text-lede);
    line-height: var(--leading-lede);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    max-width: 44rem;
  }

  /* ---- CTA row ---- */
  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: var(--space-2xs);
  }
</style>
